    <ul>
      <li>Always use context managers (with statement) for file operations</li>
      <li>File modes control read vs write vs append behavior</li>
      <li>Files must be closed to flush changes and release system resources</li>
      <li>Context managers guarantee closing even when exceptions occur</li>
